        <mxCell id="header-title" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CNP · Observability · Target: public clouds&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=24;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="64" y="30" width="2740" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e293b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;How do metrics, logs and traces of EKS and GKE reach the on-prem stores, who vouches for the cluster label, and what happens while a cloud is off?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scope: the public cloud target drawn once for EKS cnp-eks and GKE cnp-gke (same platform base, cluster=aws|gcp), the WireGuard tunnel, the on-prem doors (vmauth, collector) and the alert chain · proposal of 2026-11-14 (CNP-185, D22, wave V6)&lt;br&gt;One door for every signal: metrics, logs and spans of a cloud enter through vmauth (relay 18080 for writes, 18083 for reads), with one user per cloud whose password Vault hands to the cloud. vmauth forces cluster=&amp;lt;cloud&amp;gt; on writes (extra_label, VL-Extra-Fields, a header the gateway turns into the cluster attribute) and pins reads to that cloud: no sender is trusted for its own label.&lt;br&gt;Clouds are off most of the time. vmagent and Fluent Bit queue on disk while the tunnel is down and drain when it comes back; cnp.sh down waits for empty queues. CloudTelemetryMissing fires when Argo CD says a cloud is up and no sample arrived for 10 min.&lt;br&gt;Out of scope: OpenCost (relay 18081, on-prem to cloud) · relay 18082 (Loki) removed on 2026-11-21 with Loki and the cloud Alloy (CNP-276, Cloud#50) · per-project Grafana orgs · current stack: views observability and multicloud-links&lt;br&gt;v0.1 (2026-11-14, proposal) · source: cnp-docs/architecture/cnp&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="64" y="74" width="2740" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
